			"notes": "## v1.0.2\n\n- Fix crash (NullPointerException: Direction$Axis.ordinal()) when a Mechanical Saw / kinetic actor is pushed by a piston (Linear Actuator) contraption — rotation axis is null for non-rotating contraptions, so the rotational motion term is now skipped.\n- Contraption replay hardening: reworked spawn-data / sub-level contraption handling and replay packet hooks.\n- See MixinMovementContext and compat/ changes for details."
		},
